WEBVTT

00:08.820 --> 00:15.580
In the deepest darkness lie the sleeping butterflies.

00:16.970 --> 00:23.520
Are they even aware of the blue sky?

00:25.130 --> 00:28.550
The world is fragile, like building blocks.

00:28.680 --> 00:32.530
I want a way to fly away.

00:32.890 --> 00:36.260
I pray for only one thing

00:36.740 --> 00:40.650
for the one that I love.

00:42.430 --> 00:46.380
Now, the dices were thrown.

00:46.440 --> 00:50.390
Paradise will rise in the future.

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I Tooi yumeni musubareru

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I will unite in this far away dream.

00:54.700 --> 00:58.430
And we will cross this red river.

00:58.490 --> 01:02.230
The flower embraces the cross with uncertainty.

01:02.490 --> 01:06.390
Like that, bloomed a fickle angel.

01:06.390 --> 01:10.460
We will one day find eternal love

01:10.710 --> 01:14.760
and I will give you Paradise.

01:36.380 --> 01:39.340
Damn you... Where did you get that chain from?

01:40.300 --> 01:41.050
Plue!

01:41.890 --> 01:42.220
He-he.

01:43.010 --> 01:43.970
The little guy...

01:44.810 --> 01:47.190
Haru! Now is your only chance!

01:47.350 --> 01:49.020
Finish Lance now!

01:50.270 --> 01:52.110
Then let go of him.

01:52.360 --> 01:53.690
Otherwise this is going hit you.

01:56.320 --> 01:58.910
Who said I didn't want to be hit?

01:59.410 --> 02:01.450
Pierce through my body!

02:07.460 --> 02:08.620
Wha.. what?!

02:08.920 --> 02:09.420
Now way.

02:10.670 --> 02:12.920
Pierce through!

02:21.480 --> 02:27.360
Finale! The Explosion Sword's victory!

02:51.500 --> 02:53.960
Haru, why are you hesitating?

02:54.090 --> 02:56.920
This is your only chance to beat him!

02:57.300 --> 02:58.350
Musica...

02:58.380 --> 02:59.640
Are you serious?

02:59.670 --> 03:01.630
Are you going to betray Demon Card?

03:02.220 --> 03:05.720
I may have obeyed you, but I don't
remember becoming your servant.

03:06.510 --> 03:09.230
Bastard! If you're so eager to die, then...

03:21.570 --> 03:23.740
Musica! Get away from Lance.

03:27.410 --> 03:31.920
Beasts, bite the Rave Master to death!

03:41.170 --> 03:43.380
Why? Why are they still biting the old man?!

03:43.890 --> 03:49.470
Of course they are. I put their favorite
smell all over my body.

04:03.740 --> 04:06.450
What nerves that old man has?

04:06.950 --> 04:08.740
Hurry up, Haru!

04:09.790 --> 04:13.210
Are you going to waste the only chance you have?

04:15.750 --> 04:20.210
This is the only way for me to make
up for these past 15 years.

04:24.300 --> 04:29.430
If I don't do this, I won't be able to
face my family in the afterlife.

04:30.390 --> 04:32.230
I've lived long enough.

04:32.520 --> 04:34.730
I want to see my family.

04:52.790 --> 04:54.410
Haru! Are you really going to?

04:54.750 --> 04:55.400
Haru?!

04:55.670 --> 04:56.420
What?!

05:03.170 --> 05:04.470
That's good.

05:05.340 --> 05:06.550
Is this for real?

05:06.760 --> 05:08.590
I have no regrets.

05:13.270 --> 05:14.210
After this...

05:18.400 --> 05:20.480
I'll leave it to you, Haru.

05:26.110 --> 05:26.700
What?!

05:43.210 --> 05:44.420
Stop...

06:12.240 --> 06:13.830
He aimed for the Dark Bring?!

06:16.590 --> 06:17.480
Haru!

06:18.330 --> 06:20.560
It's ok. I'm fine, Elie.

06:26.550 --> 06:28.340
It's not over yet.

06:28.340 --> 06:29.000
Haru...

06:29.340 --> 06:30.680
But you are staggering.

06:30.970 --> 06:33.300
This is nothing.

06:34.060 --> 06:36.970
I'm still alive?

06:42.650 --> 06:44.610
Your Dark Bring is broken.

06:46.780 --> 06:49.530
I can't use explosion either.

06:53.450 --> 06:55.790
From here on, let's fight sword to sword.

06:56.910 --> 06:58.330
'Sword to sword', you say?

07:01.290 --> 07:06.340
Do you really think that a kid like you can beat me?

07:08.550 --> 07:10.760
Don't make a fool of me!

07:21.100 --> 07:22.980
Bastard!

07:28.690 --> 07:29.990
It can't be.

07:32.320 --> 07:34.070
Why can't I break through?!

07:34.450 --> 07:37.790
My beasts, why aren't they coming out?!

07:38.330 --> 07:39.910
Enough already, old man.

07:40.830 --> 07:43.620
Stop relying on your illusions!

07:45.170 --> 07:47.500
Shut up, shut up, shut up, shut up!

08:14.950 --> 08:16.700
I... lost.

08:17.780 --> 08:20.330
La-Lance is begging him.

08:20.360 --> 08:21.380
It can't be.

08:21.410 --> 08:22.370
What happened?!

08:22.910 --> 08:25.370
The Rave Master is worn out,

08:25.540 --> 08:29.210
and skills wise, Lance should be superior.

08:30.130 --> 08:31.460
I can't create the beasts.

08:31.500 --> 08:33.010
I don't have the Dark Bring.

08:33.260 --> 08:35.970
I can't win like this.

08:36.390 --> 08:37.760
Let me go.

08:37.890 --> 08:41.060
Plue, he's asking for mercy.

08:41.850 --> 08:42.930
What should we do?

08:44.480 --> 08:45.390
He said, 'No'.

08:46.020 --> 08:50.400
Please! Without Dark Bring, I'm just a punk.

08:50.980 --> 08:53.240
I'll stop doing bad things.

08:54.240 --> 08:56.410
Haru, don't be deceived.

08:56.780 --> 08:58.570
I'm not trying to trick you.

08:59.030 --> 09:01.200
I'm begging you in front of my servants.

09:01.410 --> 09:03.500
I can't even be the boss anymore.

09:04.330 --> 09:05.540
I beg you.

09:05.960 --> 09:08.210
I apologize for everything I did.

09:08.710 --> 09:10.710
I'll turn myself in.

09:11.250 --> 09:12.710
Please don't kill me.

09:13.130 --> 09:16.720
Please! Please spare my life!

09:25.180 --> 09:27.440
Old man, this fight is over.

09:27.940 --> 09:28.560
Let's go.

09:28.690 --> 09:29.860
But, Haru.

09:30.310 --> 09:33.230
Even though he's the enemy, he still deserves a chance.

09:34.490 --> 09:38.200
If you can't forgive him, you can hit him once.

09:38.660 --> 09:40.580
You don't have to kill him, right?

10:02.180 --> 10:05.100
Hit me as much as you want, Musica.

10:05.770 --> 10:12.770
I'll forgive you now for the pain
my family and I have endured...

10:15.650 --> 10:17.740
For the sake of this boy.

10:19.160 --> 10:19.360
Yup.

10:25.410 --> 10:27.370
Hey, are you ok?

10:28.620 --> 10:30.710
Is it because he used explosion too much?

10:31.250 --> 10:33.040
Hey, wake up!

10:33.170 --> 10:34.340
Haru!

10:36.710 --> 10:38.800
I'm a little tired...

10:39.670 --> 10:40.470
Haru!

10:58.740 --> 11:02.110
General Jade, your army is ready to attack.

11:03.570 --> 11:06.580
General, is it really okay?

11:08.950 --> 11:14.500
I'm afraid our attack may start a war with the Demon Card.

11:15.960 --> 11:18.630
As usual, you worry too much.

11:20.560 --> 11:21.340
But...

11:22.050 --> 11:27.220
We are only going to apprehend
those who oppose the Empire.

11:28.270 --> 11:32.810
As long as there are no political
intentions, there won't be a war.

11:33.300 --> 11:33.650
Yea...

11:34.190 --> 11:37.440
Ok, all army groups, attack!

11:37.690 --> 11:38.230
Yes!

11:38.980 --> 11:40.440
Haru, can you stand?

11:40.780 --> 11:42.110
Yeah, somehow.

11:43.320 --> 11:44.620
Finally.

11:48.620 --> 11:50.120
Okay, shall we go home?

11:50.870 --> 11:52.300
Here, hang onto me.

11:52.330 --> 11:54.250
It's ok. I can walk by myself.

11:54.290 --> 11:55.750
Why are you being so shy?

11:55.790 --> 11:58.130
I'm so hungry. I want to have a big meal.

11:58.630 --> 12:00.300
Eh? You want to eat this mushroom?

12:00.380 --> 12:01.550
Um, no. A meal.

12:15.990 --> 12:16.800
Haru!

12:23.160 --> 12:25.880
Fool! I got ya!

12:40.500 --> 12:41.670
What?!

12:45.050 --> 12:47.180
Lance was defeated.

12:47.260 --> 12:49.390
That was a dishonorable attack too.

12:49.970 --> 12:52.310
Be-besides, it only took one swing.

12:52.930 --> 12:54.940
Haru, finish him off!

12:55.100 --> 12:57.730
You must kill him this time.

12:58.770 --> 13:01.400
You saw it all. This is who he really is.

13:02.070 --> 13:03.650
He deceives people without remorse.

13:03.860 --> 13:06.070
We can't even call him a swordsman.

13:06.740 --> 13:08.820
You must kill him!

13:10.200 --> 13:12.450
Don't hesitate, Haru! Do it!

13:14.000 --> 13:14.870
I can't.

13:21.840 --> 13:25.470
No matter how bad he is, I can't kill him.

13:28.340 --> 13:31.310
So, instead of killing Lance...

13:33.270 --> 13:34.430
I'm going to destroy this sword.

13:51.780 --> 13:55.000
Is... Is he going to use explosion?

13:55.250 --> 13:56.290
N-no!

13:56.750 --> 13:58.870
You're already at your limit.

13:59.000 --> 14:01.750
It's too dangerous to use explosion now.

14:02.960 --> 14:06.190
Because of this sword, your family was killed.

14:09.720 --> 14:12.260
If I don't do it, everything will end in vain.

14:14.520 --> 14:19.900
Sacrificing yourself to beat Lance
and your fifteen years of anguish,

14:23.320 --> 14:24.730
they will definitely reach your family.

14:59.000 --> 14:59.920
Haru.

15:16.490 --> 15:17.790
What a guy...

15:18.120 --> 15:20.580
He exerted himself until he collapsed.

15:21.670 --> 15:22.790
I'm speechless...

15:28.170 --> 15:31.930
He-hey. Isn't this our chance?

15:32.090 --> 15:36.260
Although Lance was defeated, they are all weak.

15:36.720 --> 15:40.600
Compared to them, we have 30 healthy people.

15:41.270 --> 15:44.400
If one of us can get Rave...

15:44.610 --> 15:46.230
What? What's going to happen now?

15:46.570 --> 15:49.440
Stupid! Promotion to leader won't be a dream anymore!

15:49.530 --> 15:50.320
Leader?!

16:01.870 --> 16:06.000
I'm going to be...

16:06.340 --> 16:08.210
There are too many of them.

16:08.750 --> 16:11.720
If I had my Tonfa guns, I could handle them.

16:12.510 --> 16:16.010
Haru already took the coolest scene

16:16.300 --> 16:18.510
and there aren't many left, so leave this one to me.

16:18.720 --> 16:20.560
Give me Rave!

16:36.950 --> 16:39.790
S-spear? The skull became a spear?!

16:49.290 --> 16:50.680
What's going on?

16:50.710 --> 16:54.380
I've been to Punk Street many times, but
I have never seen a weapon like that!

16:57.220 --> 16:58.100
What's next?

16:59.180 --> 17:02.810
Take this! 'Gin' 'Sen' 'Kaku'

17:04.440 --> 17:05.310
Silver?!

17:06.470 --> 17:06.670
Then...

17:06.850 --> 17:07.810
That weapon is...

17:08.310 --> 17:12.650
There's no doubt about it, this guy can control silver!

17:13.030 --> 17:15.360
He is the Silver Claimer!

17:27.920 --> 17:30.040
Cool, Musica!

17:31.150 --> 17:32.040
Musica?

17:33.300 --> 17:36.220
Is his name really Musica?

17:36.930 --> 17:39.680
But there can't be another Musica except me.

17:45.770 --> 17:48.350
Just you and it's all over!

17:51.820 --> 17:53.570
Alright now, all done.

17:54.610 --> 17:56.960
We are from the Empire.

17:57.140 --> 18:00.980
Demon Card's 17th Corp. General Lance,

18:01.120 --> 18:03.580
you are hereby ordered to come with us to the capital.

18:05.040 --> 18:06.080
The Empire's army.

18:06.620 --> 18:10.130
You have until the count of 10 to open the door, or we...

18:10.160 --> 18:11.880
Break it down.

18:13.340 --> 18:14.250
Attack!

18:16.660 --> 18:19.500
Good! Everything will be fine now, right?

18:19.890 --> 18:21.300
Um... I don't know.

18:21.390 --> 18:24.810
We might get in trouble if the Empire find us.

18:26.680 --> 18:31.270
If they find out about Rave, we'll be in even more trouble.

18:31.900 --> 18:36.490
Maybe they will understand if we tell them
the truth. These are the bad guys.

18:37.070 --> 18:38.240
I'm not sure though.

18:38.570 --> 18:41.070
Do you have anything you need to hide from them?

18:41.700 --> 18:44.080
I don't know my nationality and I have no address.

18:45.330 --> 18:46.580
I'm a bandit leader.

18:48.160 --> 18:50.460
I'm a famous drunkard.

18:50.960 --> 18:53.540
Plue, let's run away, come on.

19:00.840 --> 19:02.430
Hurry! Let's go!

19:04.010 --> 19:05.140
Charge!

19:05.260 --> 19:06.720
Everyone freeze!

19:06.810 --> 19:07.720
Put down your weapons.

19:09.270 --> 19:09.940
This is...

19:10.770 --> 19:12.940
Lance's army has been completely destroyed.

19:13.310 --> 19:15.820
General Jade, what on earth...?!

19:20.450 --> 19:23.990
I don't know what happened, but arrest Lance.

19:24.490 --> 19:24.950
Yes.

19:25.490 --> 19:28.450
But this is something I'm concerned about.

19:29.250 --> 19:29.790
Huh?

19:30.960 --> 19:38.710
The Dark Bring that none of our weapons
could scratch, is in pieces.

19:39.880 --> 19:43.140
There is only one weapon that
could do something like that.

19:44.140 --> 19:50.230
A weapon that was used against the
Dark Bring 50 years ago, Rave!

19:51.810 --> 19:53.770
There's someone who can still use it?

19:57.820 --> 20:01.860
Even though we patched him up, I'm still worried.

20:02.150 --> 20:03.450
I wonder if he will be okay.

20:03.970 --> 20:04.840
Haru.

20:08.080 --> 20:09.620
What the hell are you doing?!

20:10.160 --> 20:12.920
Don't give a lollipop to someone who is sleeping.

20:15.710 --> 20:19.550
But the little guy's behavior kind of makes sense.

20:19.710 --> 20:22.010
It might be a good idea to try waking him up.

20:22.720 --> 20:23.630
By force?

20:24.380 --> 20:27.550
Mouth to mouth, artificial resuscitation.

20:28.510 --> 20:30.520
Mouth to mouth.

20:31.180 --> 20:33.100
I ain't doing that!

20:33.310 --> 20:34.980
Who would want to do that to a guy?

20:35.350 --> 20:36.270
I got it!

20:37.310 --> 20:39.230
Then, I'll try.

20:39.820 --> 20:41.650
If this is going to wake Haru.

20:42.280 --> 20:44.030
It's not like he's dead!

20:44.950 --> 20:48.870
The old man is pretty stupid, but
the girl is just as stupid as he is.

21:10.140 --> 21:11.560
Hey, Elie, good morning!

21:14.730 --> 21:16.940
It's not what you think, okay?

21:20.150 --> 21:21.440
Plue, do you want to eat some salt?

21:22.780 --> 21:24.780
What's wrong with Elie?

21:24.860 --> 21:26.950
I'll tell you later.

21:29.370 --> 21:32.450
By the way, Haru, how is your body?

21:33.870 --> 21:35.460
Not good.

21:35.830 --> 21:37.790
Sorry... It's because of me.

21:38.750 --> 21:41.130
I have never been so hungry before.

21:43.340 --> 21:44.010
What?!

21:45.010 --> 21:47.880
These guys are stupid as hell.

21:48.220 --> 21:50.260
Ok! I'm going to start drinking!

21:50.300 --> 21:51.760
This is for the victory!

21:51.810 --> 21:53.390
Didn't you quit drinking?

21:53.430 --> 21:54.980
Today is special.

21:55.200 --> 21:56.100
Okay.

21:57.890 --> 22:00.650
Hey, Plue! Don't drink so much at once!

22:13.620 --> 22:23.950
Under the moon, I became a chrysalis, kissed upon a glass sea of love.

22:23.950 --> 22:33.890
Your rhythm is like a wave, embraced by the words of its song.

22:33.890 --> 22:44.020
Live to feel me, my past disappears on the water's surface.

22:44.520 --> 22:54.630
Everything I believed in, I found with you, so...

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're wings on my heart kono negai haruka na yume no shijima ni tokete

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're the wings on my heart, this wish, a distant dream that melts on a deserted island.

23:04.860 --> 23:18.780
Nani mo nai tada anata to tadayou kuni e aoi tori douka michibi ite

23:04.860 --> 23:18.780
All I want is for the bluebird to lead me to you, and drift through the country.

23:19.060 --> 23:26.030
Toward the small sky that weeps.

23:42.980 --> 23:44.650
Again? Old man...

23:44.800 --> 23:46.160
What do you want to say this time?

23:46.190 --> 23:49.550
Musica and Musica, why do we have the same name?

23:49.580 --> 23:53.290
I don't know, but it's too Musica-ish.

23:53.330 --> 23:54.120
Is that a joke?

23:58.140 --> 23:59.250
Plue likes jokes.

23:59.340 --> 24:00.700
On the next episode of Rave

24:00.730 --> 24:02.140
Silver Rhythm's Musica

24:02.170 --> 24:04.310
Who on earth is this guy?!
